{"id":"92da433aceb4e9e5","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-regular-substitution-closure.md","title":"正则代换封闭性","display":"thm-regular-substitution-closure — 正则代换封闭性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-regular-substitution-closure","aliases":["73-thm-regular-substitution-closure"],"display":"thm-regular-substitution-closure — 正则代换封闭性","depends_on":["[[73-df-language-substitution]]","[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§4.2, print pp. 133–149; PDF pp. 155–171; local closure formulation or corollary","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 3.4, p. 60; scan 68","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":4},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-regular-substitution-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-regular-substitution-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regular-substitution-closure — 正则代换封闭性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"843165cc8d06b8df\" href=\"?note=843165cc8d06b8df\" title=\"73-df-language-substitution\">73-df-language-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§4.2, print pp. 133–149; PDF pp. 155–171; local closure formulation or corollary"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 3.4, p. 60; scan 68"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Sigma,\\Delta\\)</span> 为字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)\">\\(s:\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)\\)</span>。代换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"843165cc8d06b8df\" href=\"?note=843165cc8d06b8df\" title=\"73-df-language-substitution\">73-df-language-substitution</a>，正则语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n(\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;s(a)\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta})\\Longrightarrow s[L]\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n(\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;s(a)\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta})\\Longrightarrow s[L]\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在 L 的正则表达式中把每个字母替换为其代换语言的正则表达式。对原表达式结构归纳，代换分别保持并、连接和星，故所得表达式的语言恰为 s[L]。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-language-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"843165cc8d06b8df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-language-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-language-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"843165cc8d06b8df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\Delta$ 为字母表，$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$，$s:\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)$。代换见 [[73-df-language-substitution]]，正则语言见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\Delta$ 为字母表，$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$，$s:\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)$。代换见 [[73-df-language-substitution]]，正则语言见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n(\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;s(a)\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta})\\Longrightarrow s[L]\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta}","display":true}],"bytes":1561,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-regular-substitution-closure|正则代换封闭性]]"},{"id":"705cd151c71b2488","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["843165cc8d06b8df","c284ffb568a496fd"]}